PAGE  001   BASPATCH          



00001                     NAM    BASPATCH 
00002                     OPT    O,NOM,NOP  
00003              *THIS PROGRAM PATCHES THE ASTRAL 2000 BASIC
00004              *TO DISABLE AUTO-PAPER READ ACTIVATION WHEN ':' BASI
00005              *PROMPT IS SHOWN, AND AUTO-PAPER PUNCH ACTIVATION TH
00006              *LIST COMMAND IS ISSUED. IT ALSO FIXES BASIC LOAD/SA
00007              *AND TLOAD/TSAVE COMMANDS 
00008              *
00009              *
00010              * remove ^R ($12) PTP ON at beginning of each listed
00011              * convert JSR PRTCH in TST PRTCH to not out the char
00012 0310                ORG    $0310    
00013 0310 7D             FCB    $7D 
00014              *
00015              * remove ^R ($14) PTP OFF at beginning of each liste
00016              * convert JMP PRTCH in RTS to just return 
00017 033A                ORG    $033A 
00018 033A 39             FCB    $39 
00019              *
00020              * the following path is needed in order to read from
00021              * when TAPPEND or TLOAD commands are used
00022              * remove ^Q ($11) PTR ON issued ':' prompt
00023              * convert JSR PRTCH in TST PRTCH to not out the char
00024 0206                ORG    $0206 
00025 0206 7D             FCB    $7D 
00026              *
00027              * the following is needed to accept basic programs w
00028              * line to start by char $02 just before line number 
00029 0B8E                ORG    $0B8E 
00030 0B8E 03             FCB    $03 
00031                     END             

TOTAL ERRORS 